senses.gloss:
ख्या cl. 2. P. ख्याति (in the non-conjugational tenses also Ā., perf. चख्यौ, चख्ये, Vop.; aor. अख्यत्, अख्यत, Pāṇ. iii, 1, 52), Dhātup. xxiv, 52;
 the simple verb occurs only in Pass. and Caus.:
Pass. ख्यायते, to be named, be known, MBh. iii;
 (aor. अख्यायि) to be named or announced to (gen.), Bhaṭṭ. xv, 86 :
Caus. ख्यापयति, to make known, promulgate, proclaim, Mn.; Yājñ.; MBh. &c.;
to relate, tell, say, declare, betray, denounce, Mn. viii, 171; MBh. iii; Pañcat.; Kathās.;
 ‘to make well known, praise’, see ख्यापित;
